# Likeness Looter's "{X}: This creature becomes a copy of target creature card in your graveyard with mana value X, ..."
# with its one target gone: Bot1 pays X=2 at Embereth Shieldbreaker on turn 3 and Bot2, in response, exiles the
# Shieldbreaker with Ghost Vacuum. The target is illegal as the ability resolves, so it does nothing (CR 608.2b): the
# Looter stays a 1/1 Likeness Looter with its own abilities.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Likeness Looter
Embereth Shieldbreaker
Island x2
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Ghost Vacuum
Mountain x20

